Description: K40 Laser Cutter Control Software
 K40 Whisperer is an alternative to the laser cutter software that comes with
 cheap Chinese laser cutters available on E-Bay and Amazon. K40 Whisperer reads
 SVG and DXF files, interprets the data and sends commands to the K40 controller
 to move the laser head and control the laser accordingly.
 .
 This software was written with the intent of being cross-platform and
 open-source. It should work on Windows, Mac, and Linux.
